<title>FRANCE: Air Liquide sells Puerto Rico unit.</title>
<headline>Air Liquide sells Puerto Rico unit.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-11-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Air Liquide said on Monday it had sold its Puerto Rico unit to Sweden's Aga.</p>
<p>&quot;At a time when significant additional investment would have been required for the Puerto Rico operations, Air Liquide has chosen to reinforce its development strategy in areas where it esteems its growth opportunities are better,&quot; it said in a statement.</p>
<p>Liquid Air Puerto Rico Corporation has annual sales of about six million dollars, said the statement. It did not give the sale price.</p>
</text>
